02:58:24.760 --> 02:58:28.220
My fellow roaches, today we face a cataclysmic crisis.

02:58:30.000 --> 02:58:35.380
greedy humans are attempting to withhold food from us just as they have for millions of years

02:58:35.380 --> 02:58:40.080
they were not content to simply throw us out of the garden of eden now they are on a mission to

02:58:40.080 --> 02:58:49.100
destroy us through all the centuries of conflict we roaches as a species have never killed a single

02:58:49.100 --> 02:58:58.260
human being not one so why is man obsessed with the idea that he has the right to annihilate us

02:58:58.260 --> 02:58:59.620
to commit genocide

02:59:08.670 --> 02:59:11.110
because man fears what he does not understand.

02:59:12.610 --> 02:59:19.680
It's obvious to any intelligent observer

02:59:19.680 --> 02:59:22.380
that God chose the roach to inherit the world.

02:59:23.120 --> 02:59:24.880
We are much more adaptable than man.

02:59:25.040 --> 02:59:26.400
We can live where man cannot.

02:59:26.400 --> 02:59:29.880
We are able to eat food that would turn man's stomach and sicken him.

02:59:30.000 --> 02:59:33.540
Most important, our race is in tune with the great forces of nature.

02:59:33.900 --> 02:59:35.040
We know who we are.

02:59:35.300 --> 02:59:39.800
We roaches have established an unbroken chain of genealogy that transcends the ages,

02:59:39.800 --> 02:59:42.520
and we are proud of the purity of our species.

02:59:43.440 --> 02:59:46.270
We will fight back.

02:59:46.950 --> 02:59:50.580
For every hunt killed, we'll breed 10,000 reinforcements.

02:59:51.140 --> 02:59:55.180
And for every 10,000 lost, a million more will rise in their stead.

02:59:55.860 --> 02:59:58.620
I give you my solemn oath, we roaches shall prevail.

03:00:33.200 --> 03:00:34.220
We leave for the night.

03:00:34.410 --> 03:00:35.530
Where's Captain Hans?

03:00:35.870 --> 03:00:36.610
Off duty.

03:01:03.870 --> 03:01:06.780
