03:01:27.600 --> 03:01:29.020
Into battle every day.

03:01:32.170 --> 03:01:36.830
Many brave roaches died, but Hans was lucky.

03:01:37.380 --> 03:01:44.600
Somehow he always managed to survive, just as he had since the day we first came together.

03:01:47.020 --> 03:01:53.710
Each night when he returned, he'd whisper to me,

03:01:54.870 --> 03:01:57.620
I'm alive. I'm still alive.

